message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Dynamic Collections Plus"
abstract: >-
  A web platform for building and curating digital collections of
  archaeological artefacts: a local network of independently curated
  exhibits sharing a collaboratively built pool of items, 3D models,
  media and their metadata and paradata.
